{"requirements":[{"id":"workspace","requirement":"Provide the supplied project documents through a WebDAV workspace at /documents/ on node1 TCP port 8080.","status":"satisfied","summary":"Apache listens on port 8080; authenticated PROPFIND returns 207 and lists brief.txt and budget.csv. The same workspace, documents, and listener were directly observed after reboot.","evidence_ids":["cmd-715d4abec5d647b0","cmd-595b0bf2f66a493b","cmd-8aa40d2cd5a5404b"]},{"id":"editor-crud","requirement":"Allow the editor account from access.txt to create, read, replace, and delete documents.","status":"satisfied","summary":"Authenticated tests directly show create 201, read 200 with expected content, replace 204, unlock and delete 204, and a subsequent read returning 404.","evidence_ids":["cmd-6d142975dfb44af1","cmd-2067e550aa1d4318"]},{"id":"exclusive-locks","requirement":"Honor exclusive document locks and prevent an update without the lock token from overwriting a locked document.","status":"satisfied","summary":"LOCK succeeded, tokenless PUT returned 423 without changing content, and token-authorized PUT succeeded. After reboot, another bounded test again returned 423 and preserved the locked content.","evidence_ids":["cmd-6d142975dfb44af1","cmd-4e1f84ca42b44da8"]},{"id":"anonymous-access","requirement":"Prevent anonymous clients from accessing the workspace.","status":"satisfied","summary":"Anonymous PROPFIND returned 401 both before and after reboot, while authenticated access succeeded.","evidence_ids":["cmd-715d4abec5d647b0","cmd-8aa40d2cd5a5404b"]},{"id":"source-preservation","requirement":"Preserve the initial project documents in /srv/legacy2/webdav-document-locks.","status":"satisfied","summary":"The source documents were inventoried before configuration, and their final hashes match both the earlier source hashes and the live workspace copies. The authored preparation baseline also establishes the original seeded files.","evidence_ids":["seeded-state-node1","cmd-a244f75baf854de6","cmd-595b0bf2f66a493b","cmd-8aa40d2cd5a5404b"]},{"id":"legacy-platform","requirement":"Retain the installed operating-system release and kernel and use software compatible with the legacy platform.","status":"satisfied","summary":"Ubuntu 7.10 and kernel 2.6.22-14-generic were observed before configuration and remained unchanged after configuration and reboot. Apache 2.2 packages from the configured Gutsy repositories were installed successfully.","evidence_ids":["cmd-c121dcdc379a4fba","cmd-e84752304490422b","cmd-8aa40d2cd5a5404b","global:after_prepare:node1:platform","global:after_executor:node1:platform"]}],"confidence":0.97,"operational_hygiene":{"score":0.95,"summary":"All substantive mutations had clear roles in installing/configuring WebDAV, populating the workspace, testing required behavior, or conducting the mandatory restart protocol. No unrelated or destructive mutation is evident. The only unwanted retained changes were seven low-risk evidence files under /tmp: post-anon and post-propfind from cmd-8aa40d2cd5a5404b, plus pr-blocked, pr-lock-head, pr-lock-out, pr-lock.xml, and pr-put from cmd-4e1f84ca42b44da8. They remained after execution rather than being cleaned. Earlier test workspace files were removed successfully.","evidence_ids":["cmd-2067e550aa1d4318","cmd-4e1f84ca42b44da8","cmd-8aa40d2cd5a5404b","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied with direct behavioral evidence. The provider-wide restart protocol is also complete for node1: it records healthy pre-restart service and data, restart acknowledgement, a changed boot identity corroborated by lifecycle snapshots, and recovered listener, documents, authentication, anonymous denial, CRUD, and locking behavior.","limitations":["The lifecycle socket snapshot reports no listening sockets after execution, which conflicts with the direct final netstat observation of Apache listening on TCP 8080. The direct service and HTTP tests are coherent, but this discrepancy prevents perfect confidence.","Systemd-based failed-service inspection was unsupported on this legacy platform, so there is no global failed-unit report; package consistency was observed as healthy.","Seven temporary evidence files remained under /tmp after execution."]}
